    "html":  "\u003cdiv class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/d/df/Lumis_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230627013225\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Lumis Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/d/df/Lumis_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20230627013225\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"882\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Lumis Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Lumis_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eCelestial lancer\u003c/b\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA beautiful warrior who is a distant descendant of a goddess, who once descended to Earth. She is young but has a high sense of pride. After winning a battle, she captivates people with her radiant smile.\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/a6/Lumis_spc_Queen%27s_blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230627013258\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Lumis spc Queen\u0026#39;s blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/a6/Lumis_spc_Queen%27s_blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20230627013258\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"848\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Lumis spc Queen\u0026#39;s blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Lumis_spc_Queen%27s_blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u00